---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Enterprise i Agencije - Pitaj.io"
  description="Skalirajte korisničko iskustvo uz namjensku infrastrukturu, 99.9% SLA garanciju, ERP/CRM integracije po mjeri i agencijski whitelabel."
  currentPath="/za-firme"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1240px] px-6 py-16 lg:border-x lg:border-b border-[#e4e4e7] lg:px-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
      <!-- Left Column: Copy & Value Proposition -->
      <div>
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-[#fafafa] px-3.5 py-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#09090b]">
          Enterprise & Agencije
        </div>
        <h1 class="mt-6 text-balance text-[2.5rem] font-medium leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.035em] text-[#09090b] sm:text-[3rem] lg:text-[3.5rem]">
          AI podrška izgrađena za <span class="font-proza font-bold italic">enterprise</span> zahtjeve
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-5 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525b]">
          Stotine hiljada razgovora bez usporavanja. pitaj.io pruža posvećenu EU infrastrukturu, strogu GDPR usklađenost, integracije s ERP/CRM sistemima i direktnu inženjersku podršku za regionalne lidere.
        </p>

        <!-- Feature List -->
        <div class="mt-10 space-y-6">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-[#fafafa] text-[#09090b]">
              <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold text-[#09090b]">Namjenska infrastruktura i EU poslužitelji</h3>
              <p class="mt-1 text-[14px] text-[#71717a]">Mogućnost pokretanja na izoliranim poslužiteljima unutar Europske Unije (Frankfurt), regionalno zaključavanje podataka i potpuna kontrola mrežnog prometa.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-[#fafafa] text-[#09090b]">
              <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold text-[#09090b]">GDPR usklađenost, DPA i nulto treniranje</h3>
              <p class="mt-1 text-[14px] text-[#71717a]">Potpisujemo pravno obvezujući Ugovor o obradi podataka (DPA). Vaši interni dokumenti, cjenici i transakcije nikada se ne koriste za treniranje javnih LLM modela.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-[#fafafa] text-[#09090b]">
              <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold text-[#09090b]">99.9% Uptime SLA i posvećeni voditelj računa</h3>
              <p class="mt-1 text-[14px] text-[#71717a]">Ugovorno jamstvo dostupnosti sustava, prioritetna inženjerska podrška, prilagođena obuka vašeg tima i pomoć pri uvođenju složenih poslovnih procedura.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-[#fafafa] text-[#09090b]">
              <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold text-[#09090b]">Whitelabel partnerski program za agencije</h3>
              <p class="mt-1 text-[14px] text-[#71717a]">Isporučite AI agente svojim klijentima pod vlastitim brendom, bojama i prilagođenom domenom. Jedinstvena administratorska konzola za upravljanje svim klijentima.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Demo Lead Capture Form -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-[#fafafa] p-8 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-[#09090b]">Zatražite Enterprise prezentaciju</h2>
        <p class="mt-1 text-[14px] text-[#71717a]">Razgovarajte s našim timom i saznajte kako automatizirati vašu korisničku podršku i prodaju.</p>

        <form class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-4">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <div>
              <label class="block text-[12px] font-medium text-[#27272a]">Ime</label>
              <input type="text" required placeholder="Ana" class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-lg border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-white px-3.5 py-2 text-[14px] text-[#09090b] shadow-xs focus:border-[#09090b] focus:outline-none" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label class="block text-[12px] font-medium text-[#27272a]">Prezime</label>
              <input type="text" required placeholder="Horvat" class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-lg border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-white px-3.5 py-2 text-[14px] text-[#09090b] shadow-xs focus:border-[#09090b] focus:outline-none" />
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <label class="block text-[12px] font-medium text-[#27272a]">Poslovni email</label>
            <input type="email" required placeholder="ana@kompanija.ba" class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-lg border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-white px-3.5 py-2 text-[14px] text-[#09090b] shadow-xs focus:border-[#09090b] focus:outline-none" />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label class="block text-[12px] font-medium text-[#27272a]">Naziv kompanije ili agencije</label>
            <input type="text" required placeholder="Moj Web Shop d.o.o." class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-lg border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-white px-3.5 py-2 text-[14px] text-[#09090b] shadow-xs focus:border-[#09090b] focus:outline-none" />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label class="block text-[12px] font-medium text-[#27272a]">Mjesečni obim razgovora</label>
            <select class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-lg border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-white px-3.5 py-2 text-[14px] text-[#09090b] shadow-xs focus:border-[#09090b] focus:outline-none">
              <option>&lt; 2.500 razgovora / mjesečno</option>
              <option>2.500 - 10.000 razgovora / mjesečno</option>
              <option>10.000 - 50.000 razgovora / mjesečno</option>
              <option>50.000+ razgovora / mjesečno</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div>
            <label class="block text-[12px] font-medium text-[#27272a]">Opišite vaše specifične potrebe</label>
            <textarea rows="3" placeholder="Koje kanale trebate? (npr. WhatsApp, WooCommerce, Shopify, Helpdesk, Whitelabel za klijente...)" class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-lg border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-white px-3.5 py-2 text-[14px] text-[#09090b] shadow-xs focus:border-[#09090b] focus:outline-none"></textarea>
          </div>

          <button
            type="submit"
            class="mt-2 flex h-12 w-full items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#09090b] text-[15px] font-medium text-white shadow-sm transition-all hover:bg-[#27272a] active:scale-[0.98]"
          >
            Pošaljite zahtjev
          </button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
